{"hymn":"S216","parent":"E1360","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Qué glorioso! ¡Qué precioso","subtitle":"La plenitud del Espíritu—El llenar","syl":{"n1":"¡Qué","n2":["glo","i"],"n3":["rio","m"],"n4":["so!","t"],"n5":"¡Qué","n6":["pre","i"],"n7":["cio","m"],"n8":["so!","t"],"n9":["Vi","i"],"n10":["ve‿en","t"],"n11":"mí‿el","n12":["Es","i"],"n13":["pí","m"],"n14":["ri","m"],"n15":["tu!","t"],"n16":"La","n17":["ver","i"],"n18":["dad","t"],"n19":"El","n20":"me","n21":["re","i"],"n22":["ve","m"],"n23":["la,","t"],"n24":"Y","n25":"me","n26":["guí","i"],"n27":["a","t"],"n28":"con","n29":"Su","n30":"luz.","n31":["¡Llé","i"],"n32":["na","m"],"n33":["me,","t"],"n34":["llé","i"],"n35":["na","m"],"n36":["me,","t"],"n37":["Llé","i"],"n38":["ne","m"],"n39":["me","t"],"n40":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n41":["pí","m"],"n42":["ri","m"],"n43":["tu!","t"],"n44":"Me","n45":["des","i"],"n46":["po","m"],"n47":["je,","t"],"n48":"me","n49":["va","i"],"n50":["cí","m"],"n51":["e,","t"],"n52":["Llé","i"],"n53":["ne","m"],"n54":["me","t"],"n55":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n56":["pí","m"],"n57":["ri","m"],"n58":["tu.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Hoy conforme a Tu promesa","Ya Tu vida mora‿en mí;","Me libera del pecado,","Y a mi muerte pone fin."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Yo anhelo‿el agua viva;","Tan sediento‿estoy de Ti.","Que Tu plenitud yo beba","Hasta que fluyas de mí."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Oh Señor, que muera‿al ego,","Quiero‿andar en sumisión;","Oh, transfórmame a Tu imagen,","Hasta que te‿exprese yo."]}]}